#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#VS Commands linked on the tire data screen are used to rescale the internal CarSim table-based tire model.
#
#The rescaled tires linked to this vehicle, "E-Class, Sedan, Rescaled Tire Data", use normalized data that is then rescaled using the tire load rating.
#
#This simulation is overlaid with the E-Class sedan using tire data as measured, with units of N for forces, N-m for moments, etc. The overlay is also set up to export simulation results to an Excel .CSV file.
